<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the</p>
<p>Marbella world series men's tennis tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat 4-Alex Corretja (Spain) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
